/target

# Vendored crate source (created by `cargo vendor` for offline builds).
# Never version: the same content ships in the lockfile and would balloon
# the repo by hundreds of MB.
/vendor

# Per-project SlugAudit runtime database (created when the repo is activated).
# Never version: it is binary, machine-local, and excluded from discovery by
# src/sync/discovery.rs itself.
/.planning/slugaudit/

# Mutation-testing output (created by `cargo-mutants mutants` without an
# explicit --output). Never version: it is a per-run artifact. cargo-mutants
# renames a pre-existing run's directory to `mutants.out.old` on re-run, so
# both names are ignored.
/mutants.out/
/mutants.out.old/
